.TH EPOLL_CREATE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
epoll_create \- creates an epoll instance
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/epoll.h>
.B int epoll_create(int size);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates an epoll instance. The obsolete size hint must be positive. Close the returned descriptor when finished.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR epoll_create (2)
